  "learningObjectives": [
    "Recognize anaphylaxis clinically and give intramuscular epinephrine first, without delay (EV-ANA-001, EV-ANA-010, EV-ANA-011)",
    "Choose the safe epinephrine route — IM anterolateral thigh, never an undiluted IV bolus in a patient with a pulse (EV-ANA-015)",
    "Support airway, breathing and circulation: positioning, high-flow oxygen, IV fluid bolus for hypotension (EV-ANA-020, EV-ANA-021, EV-ANA-022)",
    "Reassess after the dose and treat adjuncts as adjuncts — antihistamines and steroids never substitute for epinephrine (EV-ANA-012, EV-ANA-023, EV-ANA-024)",
    "Choose a biphasic-risk-aware disposition: observation or admission, never immediate discharge (EV-ANA-030)"
